   "titulo": "To want and ask",
   "texto": [
    "**İstiyorum** means «I want to». Before the verb, what you want is placed: **Bir çay istiyorum** (I want a tea).",
    "To order with courtesy, you can say **Bir çay, lütfen** (a tea, please). **Alabilir miyim?** means «Can I take / receive?» and is an educated request.",
    "**Ne alırsınız?** = what will you take? The **-sınız** termination is formal / plural."
   ]
  },
